WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Open the feature’s Design tab.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.991
Choose Prepare in Figma and select source
and device.

00:00:10.391 --> 00:00:16.300
Check the linked file; ask a project lead
to link it if needed.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.336
Refresh workspaces in the plugin, then
Prepare workspace.

00:00:22.736 --> 00:00:26.373
Reference preserves the source. Design
holds your replacement.
